{
  "type": "Collection",
  "id": "inweva-2025-werkdag",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "Average workday (werkdag) traffic volumes for 2025 on 3,851 segments of the Rijkswaterstaat hoofdwegennet, from [INWEVA](https://data.overheid.nl/dataset/56294-intensiteit-wegvakken--inweva--2024) (INtensiteiten op WEgVAkken): motor vehicles and freight classes (personenauto's, middelzwaar en zwaar vrachtverkeer) per etmaal and per dagdeel (dag 7-19, avond 19-23, nacht 23-7), plus vrachtpercentages. Intensities are measured on roughly 4,000 segments and model-estimated elsewhere, per Rijkswaterstaat's dataset description. Source: [RWS ArcGIS Feature Service](https://rijkswaterstaat.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=8f0b2065d62d4a19a7315f7d44c6a218), CC0. Segment ids reference NWB wegvakken via the nwb_ids column; the join recipe is in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).",
